{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/a8c3199478da4e8d79a600f9fecae87f.poster.avif?t=1773311682\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/a8c3199478da4e8d79a600f9fecae87f.webm?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/a8c3199478da4e8d79a600f9fecae87f.mp4?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wondered what it\u2019s like to work in IT? <strong>IT Specialist Simulator\u00a0</strong>puts you in the shoes of an IT enthusiast, facing real-world challenges. Diagnose network and system failures, repair and manage IT infrastructure, and prioritize tasks based on SLAs. As you progress, you\u2019ll choose a career path, from frontline support to high-level administration or IT management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <u><strong>IT SPECIALIST SIMULATOR\u00a0</strong></u>\u00a0you will test your troubleshooting skills, balance workloads, and climb the corporate IT ladder\u2014all while learning real IT knowledge that applies beyond the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Realistic IT Simulation \u2013 Troubleshoot, repair, and manage IT systems and networks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 Career Progression \u2013 Start as a rookie and specialize in roles like Network Admin or IT Project Manager.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a1 Tactical Decision-Making \u2013 Prioritize urgent tasks and keep everything running.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf93 Hands-On IT Learning \u2013 Gain real tech knowledge while playing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbc Diverse Job Roles \u2013 Work as HelpDesk, Server Admin, Field Technician, and more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Fast-paced challenges \u2013 Handle unexpected breakdowns, system crashes, and critical tech emergencies.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Career</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can decide which development path to choose. You can choose to grow as a computer specialist or, for instance, as a specialist for e-sports events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/5783b6564e71f2f6f2482ad168bc2e78.poster.avif?t=1773311682\" width=610 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/5783b6564e71f2f6f2482ad168bc2e78.webm?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/5783b6564e71f2f6f2482ad168bc2e78.mp4?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Game Mechanics and Principles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game enables interactive management of IT infrastructure and solving real-life problems using actual system commands. You\u2019ll manage and repair systems. But this is just the tip of the iceberg; the game will offer many development opportunities and mechanics that reflect real-world challenges. Through the game, we aim to showcase many elements of the IT industry in a simpler way, helping players acquire additional skills they might not gain in school before their first real job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/a396cc5fe9c98d2e9538d3350aa2336f.poster.avif?t=1773311682\" width=610 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/a396cc5fe9c98d2e9538d3350aa2336f.webm?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/a396cc5fe9c98d2e9538d3350aa2336f.mp4?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere and IT Work Simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It describes typical technical challenges and career decisions that help build an authentic IT work experience \u2013 from router configuration to task prioritization and workload management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/bac945cb0ef856180f5dfdb23f0e4c02.poster.avif?t=1773311682\" width=610 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/bac945cb0ef856180f5dfdb23f0e4c02.webm?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/bac945cb0ef856180f5dfdb23f0e4c02.mp4?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diversity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player is different, so the game will have various game modes. One of the most interesting modes is the learning mode. Here, all game devices can be disassembled, letting players see how they\u2019re built and how they function. Each device will come with several failure simulations and repair procedures, so you can quickly gain new skills. Remember, IT is more than just a computer and a monitor\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/220b1c7384b3e67edcd57af36ed24c12.poster.avif?t=1773311682\" width=610 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/220b1c7384b3e67edcd57af36ed24c12.webm?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/220b1c7384b3e67edcd57af36ed24c12.mp4?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to survive in IT? Jump in and prove your skills!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Page 404 visited","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3266090/309021a6a77009d81804337131ba1439e1d60768.jpg"},{"name":"It really wasn't difficult","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3266090/92b2f1986157454ba6395724bd260e65ab6e6e24.jpg"},{"name":"Does it work?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3266090/032163de464b6571f7b3ddf7c13f43651c8d2eab.jpg"},{"name":"Addressing? It's simple!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3266090/dd4e12cb15a990adb3062e39789db4abb6e2b252.jpg"},{"name":"Someday I'll find it...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3266090/223692dbdfbeb0fb0871073162ee9387ebe079b3.jpg"},{"name":" How to get rid of it?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3266090/3266aa6a1174f192ffb1403dd7cf07bb48044d61.jpg"},{"name":"Because safety is the basis!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3266090/ce9287c68c83fb8f670352bca643762c84b4cf42.jpg"},{"name":"Escaping from work?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3266090/537192ab9954467d9b6760dab01d639fbd9ee563.jpg"},{"name":"Someone probably didn't clean here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3266090/0f297f5752322ae85d18fc12efa5b3fe521190ce.jpg"},{"name":"Almost like new","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3266090/81ebf247c52f95ce66bff489dad85137efd92403.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3266090?t=1773311682","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/e4f3501ebdd6b643f1157350eaff8ad3125277e4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773311682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/a9bcea1c9716acaaad474d39690dcb04aacbdafa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773311682","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/a9bcea1c9716acaaad474d39690dcb04aacbdafa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773311682","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3388180,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/a8c3199478da4e8d79a600f9fecae87f.poster.avif?t=1773311682\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/a8c3199478da4e8d79a600f9fecae87f.webm?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/a8c3199478da4e8d79a600f9fecae87f.mp4?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wondered what it\u2019s like to work in IT? <strong>IT Specialist Simulator\u00a0</strong>puts you in the shoes of an IT enthusiast, facing real-world challenges. Diagnose network and system failures, repair and manage IT infrastructure, and prioritize tasks based on SLAs. As you progress, you\u2019ll choose a career path, from frontline support to high-level administration or IT management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <u><strong>IT SPECIALIST SIMULATOR\u00a0</strong></u>\u00a0you will test your troubleshooting skills, balance workloads, and climb the corporate IT ladder\u2014all while learning real IT knowledge that applies beyond the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Realistic IT Simulation \u2013 Troubleshoot, repair, and manage IT systems and networks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 Career Progression \u2013 Start as a rookie and specialize in roles like Network Admin or IT Project Manager.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a1 Tactical Decision-Making \u2013 Prioritize urgent tasks and keep everything running.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf93 Hands-On IT Learning \u2013 Gain real tech knowledge while playing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbc Diverse Job Roles \u2013 Work as HelpDesk, Server Admin, Field Technician, and more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Fast-paced challenges \u2013 Handle unexpected breakdowns, system crashes, and critical tech emergencies.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Career</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can decide which development path to choose. You can choose to grow as a computer specialist or, for instance, as a specialist for e-sports events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/5783b6564e71f2f6f2482ad168bc2e78.poster.avif?t=1773311682\" width=610 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/5783b6564e71f2f6f2482ad168bc2e78.webm?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/5783b6564e71f2f6f2482ad168bc2e78.mp4?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Game Mechanics and Principles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game enables interactive management of IT infrastructure and solving real-life problems using actual system commands. You\u2019ll manage and repair systems. But this is just the tip of the iceberg; the game will offer many development opportunities and mechanics that reflect real-world challenges. Through the game, we aim to showcase many elements of the IT industry in a simpler way, helping players acquire additional skills they might not gain in school before their first real job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/a396cc5fe9c98d2e9538d3350aa2336f.poster.avif?t=1773311682\" width=610 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/a396cc5fe9c98d2e9538d3350aa2336f.webm?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/a396cc5fe9c98d2e9538d3350aa2336f.mp4?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere and IT Work Simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It describes typical technical challenges and career decisions that help build an authentic IT work experience \u2013 from router configuration to task prioritization and workload management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/bac945cb0ef856180f5dfdb23f0e4c02.poster.avif?t=1773311682\" width=610 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/bac945cb0ef856180f5dfdb23f0e4c02.webm?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/bac945cb0ef856180f5dfdb23f0e4c02.mp4?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diversity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player is different, so the game will have various game modes. One of the most interesting modes is the learning mode. Here, all game devices can be disassembled, letting players see how they\u2019re built and how they function. Each device will come with several failure simulations and repair procedures, so you can quickly gain new skills. Remember, IT is more than just a computer and a monitor\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/220b1c7384b3e67edcd57af36ed24c12.poster.avif?t=1773311682\" width=610 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/220b1c7384b3e67edcd57af36ed24c12.webm?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/220b1c7384b3e67edcd57af36ed24c12.mp4?t=1773311682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to survive in IT? Jump in and prove your skills!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Pixel Team RED"],"dlc":[4322720],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/632b9dbf26fe112da4222fc931fb84307391c42b/header.jpg?t=1773311682","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3266090/327490494/3017522ada8372eac34e92662653c70ba1c7ac6b/1763501887/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763594485","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3266090/327490494/3017522ada8372eac34e92662653c70ba1c7ac6b/1763501887/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763594485","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3266090/327490494/3017522ada8372eac34e92662653c70ba1c7ac6b/1763501887/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763594485","id":257234067,"name":"IT Specialist Simulator Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257234067/2a20ef50494bbc6e661a5e2f279c66490981c4f7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763594485"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3266090/1125766866/80fcb57db037bdf230db9c72b0f5cc92720d6fad/1757790395/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757855714","dash_